          "text": "Two Counters, Two Jobs"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "The payload is freed when strong hits 0",
            "The `RcBox` header lives until weak hits 0 too",
            "A lingering `Weak` holds the header, not the `T`",
            "`strong_count` + `weak_count` trace ownership in tests"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Finding Leaks In Practice",
          "text": "The compiler cannot catch cycles. Track the counts, watch memory in a loop, or run under Valgrind or heaptrack."
        },
